 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013. 1. 24(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">목</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">) (장학금 대상 학생 모두 지급계좌 입력시 가능)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">※ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">장학금 수혜내역은 원스톱서비스</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학생지원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">장학금</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">대출금에서 확인가능 합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">단</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">장학금 지급 대상 학생들이 모두 장학금 지급계좌를 원스톱에 등록했을 때 지급내역 확인이 가능하므로</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><font color=\"#ff00dd\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">계좌 미등록 학생들</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">문자발송완료</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1/23(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">오전 12시까지 입력해주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #f200f2; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span>&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">**</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">모든 학생 계좌 입력 시 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1/23(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">오후부터 확인 가능합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#cc723d\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">※ 현재(1/23(수)-오후 4시 46분) 이후 원스톱에서 장학금 지급내역 확인 가능합니다. 원스톱에는 <font color=\"#008299\">장학금명이 \"발전기금일반장학금</font>\"으로 되어 있으며, 2012-2학기 장학금이므로 <font color=\"#008299\">지급일이 \"지급</font>\"으로&nbsp;되어있습니다.&nbsp;착오없으시기 바랍니다.</span></o:p></span></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#cc723d\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">장학금은 1/24(목) 늦은 오후 지급 확인하시면 됩니다.</span></o:p></span>&nbsp; </strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><font color=\"#cc723d\">문의 : ☏478-7046</font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#cc723d\"><strong></strong></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#cc723d\"><strong><o:p></o:p></strong></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 1. 22.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">금오공대 학생처장</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
